window.products.push({"id":1147017,"name":"PureRejuva Wedding Dress Shopping Signs Paddles - Say yes to the Dress Props – Ideal for Bridal Dress Shopping Fun with your Bridesmaids (25 Pieces)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bqRQAF+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Wedding dress shopping signs are a big hit with the bridal party. If you're looking for the perfect addition to your wedding dress shopping kit, look no further than these yes to the dress props. You can give your opinion on wedding dress shopping with these super cute worthy signs printed with premium finish. EXCEPTIONAL FEATURES: Beautifully printed on 300gsm cardstock our bridal dress signs make wedding dress shopping fun. The perfect addition to the wedding dress experience and a thoughtful way to surprise the bride. Featuring 24 dress shopping signs for the bridal party (3 sets of the 8 designs) on strong craft sticks and a yes to the dress sign for the bride. PERFECT CHOICE: Have you ever seen those pictures on Instagram and on wedding blogs of brides shopping with their bridesmaids and their family, and the entire tribe has these cute little signs where everyone can vote on the dresses that they love and don't love. With this adorable package you can enjoy your wedding dress shopping to fullest. ULTIMATE USAGE: We’ve designed eight different signs that are printed on premium cards. they are signs for your bridesmaids and there is one sign for you when you finally find the wedding dress of your dreams. These voting signs are designed with sharp printing color and elegant design. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: Surprise the bride when she comes out in the first dress by holding up a wedding dress shopping sign. We want you to love our precious bride wedding dress shopping signs as much as we do. If you are not happy with our products for any reason, please return your products for a new replacement or a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bqRQAF+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureRejuva","source_asin":"B085DJBRSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085DJBRSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085DJBRSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
