window.products.push({"id":1147068,"name":"Cleaza Ice Cube Tray 4 Pack, Silicone Ice Cube Trays with Removable Lid Easy Release Flexible Ice Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mXhikZbEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prefect Ice Cube Mold that provide you pleasant ice-making experience, step up your at-home ice game! Are you tired of using an ice tray that leaks all over your freezer?  Are you headache in trying to get the ice cubes out at sometimes?  Are you tired of the smells of chemicals in the ice?  What things would be make you more happy and relax after busy work? Just one ice coffee or your favorite cold drinks! Why Choose Our Ice Cube Trays With Lids? Here’s the Benefits.   This 4 pack ice cube trays with 14 ice cubes is made of food-safe silicone material,can be used for making adult and baby food, suitable for home, bar, party, etc. And flexible silicone bottom make ice easy to release, perfect for making ice cubes or filling the molds with drinks, fruit, yogurt, jelly, chocolate. You can use it to DIY delicious cold food that you favorite! 1: Hard PP frame supports the ice tray well, and the soft bottom for easy pop out.  2:Made of Silicone material and PP material which are certified by LFGB, high quality materials safe and durable ..  3:Set of 4 ice trays allow you to make 56 ice cubes at once. 4:Dishwasher safe, easy to clean.  5:Removeable lid for resisting dirt and odor, also allows you to stack up 4 ice trays together, much space saving.  6:Multi-purpose mold for making ice cube,baby food,coffee ice,drinks 3 Simple Steps to Make Cool Drinks: 1.Add water to the standard level 2.Cover the lid and put it into freezer 3.Release and enjoy your cool drinks Perfect Fruit Frozen Cubes, Simple Made: 1.Add some fruit into the ice cube tray 2.Add water, milk or juice to the standard level 3.Cover the lid and put the tray into frezer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mXhikZbEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cleaza","source_asin":"B09MQCF8NN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MQCF8NN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MQCF8NN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
