window.products.push({"id":1147078,"name":"50 pack Mylar Bags for Food Storage, 9.5mil thick. Mylar bags with Oxygen Absorbers. Mylar Bags 1 Gallon and Quart sizes. Long Term Food Storage bags ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oMF-CR0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"50 Pack of Extra Thick Mylar Bags, 9.5mil on the gal mylar bags and 9mil on the quart bags, thicker than other companies with 5ml mylar bags. Zip top makes the bags reusable for short term use, and they are also heat sealable for long term storage. Store dehydrated food, freeze-dried food, beans, nuts, candy, seeds, dried milk, and more. 400cc Oxygen Absorbers included with a higher absorbency than others with only 300cc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oMF-CR0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B7XVR2CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7XVR2CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7XVR2CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147079,"name":"P'kolino Little Reader Chair, Light Blue (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81908HuyDDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabulously cozy, supremely stable, and fashionably funky. This feathery light chair, with its two pockets for stuff and a handle to take it all wherever they go, will soon be your child's favorite. Perfectly sized for toddlers, this durable chair is available in several magnificent color combinations. It is feathery light so with the aid of the handle your little one can tote this chair to their favorite quiet spot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81908HuyDDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P'Kolino","source_asin":"B00EQBNW8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EQBNW8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EQBNW8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147080,"name":"FIZZICS - DraftPour Beer Dispenser - Converts Any Can or Bottle Into a Nitro-Style Draft, Awesome Gift for Beer Lovers - Copper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Be27eZ6EL._AC_.jpg","description":"There's a time and a place for drinking beer straight from the bottle or can. That time is officially up. And that place no longer exists. With the Fizzics DraftPour, you can enjoy fresh nitro-style draft beer anywhere. The dense Fizzics Micro-Foam head enhances the texture and aroma, bringing out the full flavor of your favorite beer. Fizzics Micro-Foam locks in flavor makes every beer style taste better. It?s not even close. DraftPour is our third generation product featuring our patented Micro-Foam technology. Completely redesigned with features and benefits based on feedback from customers, brewmasters, beer drinkers, and four years of taste testing every beer we could find. Fizzics converts any beer into a smooth and creamy nitro-style pour that will take your bottles, cans and growlers to another level. Take note of uniformly packed bubbles generated by a Fizzics pour compared to a traditional hand pour or straight from a tap. The different phases of \"head\" are critical to brewers and cicerones (sommelier of beer) where the bubbles start to form (nucleation), rise to form the head (beading), and then mature (disproportionation). Fizzics optimizes all three phases with one easy push of DraftPour?s tap handle! We are on a relentless journey to make every beer a premium experience no matter your favorite style or where you choose to consume it. Fizzics not only improves the taste and mouth feel of beer, it also brings people together in the name of creativity and adventure. We never settle. We're constantly striving to improve and advance. One beer at a time. Beer poured through a DraftPour is a truly unique experience and we are thrilled to share it with beer lovers around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Be27eZ6EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIZZICS","source_asin":"B07VCVQ39R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VCVQ39R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VCVQ39R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
