window.products.push({"id":1147093,"name":"Breaktime Group Model Break Room Furniture Combo \"Ready-To-Install/Ready-To-Use\", Espresso/Grey Metallic, 2 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O5nDJJKkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finally. A simple, practical, affordable way to furnish a break room. It has always been a real challenge to find \"purpose-built\" break room furniture, until Breaktime. Our designers and engineers have created an instant solution to furnishing a break room. Without wasting time and money going to big-box stores to find sub-standard cabinets to use in your break room. Or searching for a carpenter to design a custom-built solution at a very high prices. With Breaktime you are ready to use your new break room in a very short time. The only logical solution when shopping for break room furniture. The complete group has all the essential elements for a very functional, practical and durable break room. Each piece is full commercial grade, with melamine lamination for high use areas, high impact edges to withstand bumps and dings, completely finished edges front, back and bottom for high Usage, with solid back panels to make the cabinets perfectly square and rigid and easy-to-install back splashes on prep stations and trash stations to increase functionality and control liquid spills and food falling behind the cabinets. The hinges and hardware are European quality, with hi-end soft-close hinges. All the pieces are completely assembled (no frustrating assembly of dozens of panels and hundreds of screws). The only piece you need to attach is the back splash. It only takes a couple of minutes to attach with 4 simple keys. Finally, a manufacturer has thought of eliminating the frustration of assembling furniture. We know your business time is far too valuable to be wasted trying to put a piece of break room furniture together. Just open the carton, remove the fully assembled cabinet, put it in it's place. And start preparing for your break. By the way. Check out the amazing packaging in the \"images\" area, you will be very confident of our packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O5nDJJKkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Breaktime","source_asin":"B01D0JVNI0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D0JVNI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D0JVNI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
