window.products.push({"id":1147111,"name":"Wooden Mason Jar Lids - 4 Mason Jar Lids Wide Mouth (Rubberwood) - Custom Molded Screw Top Mason Jar Lid Set Compatible Storage Lids for Kerr and Ball","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iYQnfIZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹 BEST-FITTING LIDS FOR USA-MADE MASON JARS - Isn’t it annoying when reusable lids are loose, leak and not airtight?! Did you know it’s because of the difference in the “SAE” style measurements on the JAR, vs the metric measures used for LIDS! So to create the perfect seal, we 3D Custom Molded ours from actual Mason Canning Jars! So the next time you open yours, the only surprise you’ll get is how fresh everything is! 🛢️ WON’T SPLIT OR GET GRIMY: We’ve seen those wide mouth lids too. You know the ones, cork lids that get grimy and two-piece bamboo lids that split (not to mention the unmatched wood-grain!) So if you need a little more style than that for reusable kitchen storage, storing bath salts, or decorative jar lids, you’ll naturally appreciate our selection of REAL wood tops! 🌳 WIDE MOUTH MASON JAR LIDS FOR BALL BRAND JARS: If you need Regular Mouth Mason jar lids, see our other options - because these ones you’re looking at here are Wide Mouth, Rubberwood (Jars NOT Included). 3 3/4 (3.75 inches) across, 1 inch high and fit perfectly to your 3 1/4 (3.25 inches) Wide Mouth Ball Jars. NOTE: Not suitable for preserving (canning) or water immersion. 🥤 AIR-TIGHT SEAL: See the threads inside our Mason Jar tops? It’s made from BPA Free ABS Plastic. Unlike wooden threads, not only does ABS prevent from warping, but it creates an airtight seal. NEW: now featuring highest quality silicone seals. They are Food Safe, washable, and help your jar tops lock in freshness. ⭐ LIDS THAT LAST! To ensure your lids fit perfectly for a long time, keep them dry and don’t put them in the dishwasher! Instead, like all real wood products, simply wipe clean with a dry cloth. If you find a Mason lid that’s not to your standard in this set, they won’t meet ours either, so we offer a 30-Day Replace or Refund Guarantee. We have Regular Mouth and Wide Mouth sizes – so choose your style now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iYQnfIZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITCHEN CHARISMA","source_asin":"B07SS2BPC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS2BPC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SS2BPC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
