window.products.push({"id":1147146,"name":"DeLonghi Metropolis CTM4023 4-Slice Toaster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412EF3ZM5ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Delonghi Metropolis Toaster has a sleek, Attractive Metropolis design and a durable graphite finish, beautifully complements any kitchen decor. It has Dual Electric Browning Controls that allow you to adjust toast color to your exact preference. There is a cord storage that allows you to keep out of harms way when the toaster is not in use. The non-slip feet safely secures toaster during use. Amazon.com As sleek and curvy as a 1950s car, DeLonghi's Metropolis four-slice toaster marries stylish retro looks with accurate, versatile functionality. Better still, this capacious model features dual controls for the right and left sides, so you can toast for different preferences simultaneously. The slots are wide enough to fit bagels, thickly sliced sourdough, and English muffins, and an extra-high lift lever raises small pieces to a safe grasping height. Self-adjusting bread grips center each slice for consistent results, while a smooth-turning dial adjusts the six browning settings. A defrost function thaws frozen bread before toasting it, and a bagel setting toasts the cut side of a bagel while simply warming its crust. A cancel button interrupts any setting immediately, and indicator lights help you double-check settings from across the room. Made from durable metal, the toasters housing is a handsome graphite color with shiny chrome accents. Helpful details include power cord storage, non-slip feet, and two dishwasher-safe crumb trays. A bit of a showpiece, the Metropolis looks good on the counter but, at 12 by 14 by 8-1/4 inches, it does have a substantial footprint. DeLonghi includes a one-year warranty. --Emily Bedard From the Manufacturer DeLonghi's Metropolis four-slice toaster has many excellent features, including an attractive, modern design. Metropolis...the future as seen from the past. Four extra-wide slots work in concert with self-adjusting bread grips to center bread for precise, double-sided toasting. Four extra-wide slots work in concert with self-adjusting bread grips to center bread for precise, double-sided toasting. Metropolis design: this unique and aggressive line, designed in Italy, is reminiscent of art deco style mixed with a future-forward twist. Metropolis design: this unique and aggressive line, designed in Italy, is reminiscent of art deco style mixed with a future-forward twist. Dual cancel, defrost, and bagel functions let you toast to perfection. The \"bagel\" function for perfectly toasted bagels every time, and the \"defrost\" function thaws waffles, English muffins, and more. Dual cancel, defrost, and bagel functions let you toast to perfection. The \"bagel\" function for perfectly toasted bagels every time, and the \"defrost\" function thaws waffles, English muffins, and more. Dual electronic browning controls allow you to adjust toast color to your exact preference. Dual electronic browning controls allow you to adjust toast color to your exact preference. Dual extra-high lift levers safely bring toasted items to the ideal height for easy removal. Dual extra-high lift levers safely bring toasted items to the ideal height for easy removal. Dual slide-out crumb trays are dishwasher-safe making cleanup a breeze. Dual slide-out crumb trays are dishwasher-safe making cleanup a breeze. Cord storage keeps the power cord out of harm's way when toaster is not in use. Cord storage keeps the power cord out of harm's way when toaster is not in use. Non-slip feet safely secures toaster during use. Non-slip feet safely secures toaster during use. Designed and engineered in Italy Designed and engineered in Italy See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412EF3ZM5ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B0001B4T1E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001B4T1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001B4T1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
