window.products.push({"id":1147157,"name":"Opoiar 2 Inches Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Twin Size Gel Infused Ventilated Bed Topper, Soft Foam Topper for Pressure Relieving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X-fuZLJkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a comfort layer to your mattress immediately with the Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper. The gel memory foam mattress bed topper rejuvenates your existing mattress and prevents long-term wear and tear. We offer you 2\" and 3\" profiles. This bed foam topper prevents overheating and conforms to the contours of your body to reduce your aches and pains while you sleep. With a healthier night's sleep, you'll feel energized. ➤ Soft & Firm Soft, supportive memory foam helps relieve pressure points by distributing weight evenly. ➤ Gel Infusion Memory foam is infused with gel to regulate temperature by trapping and distributing heat. ➤ Safe The foam is certified to CertiPUR U.S. quality standards. ➤ Vented Design Unlike traditional memory foam, this topper features a ventilated design that provides excellent airflow and temperature regulation. This increased breathability means you can rest more comfortably. Tips for you 1) Do I have to wait to sleep on this mattress topper? We recommend leaving the foam flat in a well-ventilated area for 48-72 hours before bedtime. This is because it takes time to inflate the foam and allow the smell of the new product to dissipate. 2) Do l smell when l open it? If you experience an odor, please don't worry, it is the smell of \"fresh foam\" and is not harmful to human body. 3) If you encounter any problems with the product, please let us know your problems before sending it back and we will solve the problem! 3\"TWIN 74″*37.5″*3″ 3\"FULL    74″*52.5″*3″ 3\" QUEEN79″*59″*3″ 2\" QUEEN 79″*59″*2″ 2\" KING 79″*75″*2″","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X-fuZLJkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Opoiar","source_asin":"B09XT7HDCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XT7HDCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XT7HDCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
