window.products.push({"id":1147175,"name":"Christmas Tree Topper Bow, Red Buffalo Plaid Tree Topper Farmhouse Christmas Decor, Burlap Wreath Bows Xmas Tree Topper Rustic Handmade Tree Toppers C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-Z2jwSpBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【Handmade Farmhouse Tree Topper】：For a rustic feel, consider this neutral bow featuring red gingham trim christmas star tree topper. This rustic tree topper is created with a 2.4\" natural linen like ribbon with red gingham wire edge. Tie off the tip of your Christmas tree with a plaid red bow and let the ribbon strands elegantly fall down over the boughs. The bow adds a classic look with maximum charm. 🎄【Easy To Use】: 13 Beautiful Sturdy Canvas Christmas Tree Bows made with 3 ribbons. the bow is tiled when it is received, and if there are wrinkles, you can iron to smooth and adjust the ears to make it a three-dimensional bow. Ribbed with wire, this christmas tree bow topper is easy to secure to your tree. The tree topper bow are re-useable for years to come. Just gently re-fluff them for each use. They easily twist onto tree branch limbs. 🎄【Applicable Occasions】: These farmhouse christmas decor bows are suitable for different kinds of occasions, which can be widely applied in Christmas party or activities, country wedding, home decors. rustic christmas tree topper can as a Christmas Tree Topper , Wreath , Garland , Staircase , Fireplace , Door Front Decor . Gift Basket, Lamp Post , Door Hanger ....and more. Wonderful for a Vintage, Classic or Rustic Christmas Decoration this Season. 🎄【Suitable For Most Christmas Tree】: Perfect for just about any style of tree, this burlap tan and red gingham bow is full of charm. The christmas tree star topper is 11 inches by 15 inches, Length 53 inches. which is suitable for most tree. Accent your evergreen in a rustic look using this bow tree topper. Multiple loops create the bow at the top, this red tree topper is a wonderful addition to your holiday presentation. 🎄【Merry Christmas】: Bring a classic look to your holiday home using this buffalo plaid christmas tree topper. If you have any questions on our vintage tree topper, please feel free to contact us, We will try our best to solve it for you until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-Z2jwSpBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PYBBO","source_asin":"B09MB1G9WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MB1G9WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MB1G9WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
