window.products.push({"id":1147180,"name":"(Pack of 2) Mini Ice Cube Trays, 36 Ice Cubes Mold Reusable, Small Ice Trays with Lids, Square DIY Ice Box, Stackable and Easy Release Ice Cubes, Used","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFO24pk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Ice tray is made of transparent food grade 5 PP plastic, no odor. And the ice tray is concave and convex design. Therefore, when the ice cubes are frozen, the ice tray are not sticky and can be stacked! Detail: Ice tray size: 10.1 * 4.6 inchesEach ice cube size: 0.78*0.78*0.7 inchesMaterial: Food Grade 5 PP plasticSet of 2 ice trays, each 36 ice cubes, allow you to make 78 ice cubes at once. Ideal for bar ice buckets. Ice picking method: 1. After icing, take the ice tray out of the refrigerator and put it for 3 minutes (to make the ice tray restore toughness). 2. Hold the ice tray diagonally with both hands, slowly twist it, the ice tray will be deformed, the ice buces is squeezed and loosened. 3. Flip the ice tray, and the bottom of the ice tray is gently tapped, and the ice cubes will be taken out (the longer the freezing time, the harder the ice cubes are and the easier it is to take out). Note: 1. Do not use wire brush or abrasive powder to clean, so as to avoid scratches on the ice tray, it is difficult to remove the ice. 2. Do not directly clean it with strong detergent to prevent the ice tray from being corroded.3. Do not close to the fire source and high temperature,to prevent deformation.4. Do not be placed in the microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFO24pk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madowl","source_asin":"B07R1S6RKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R1S6RKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R1S6RKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147181,"name":"Clonex Clone Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LbMahZZ6L._AC_.jpg","description":"The Clonex clone kit is an all-inclusive cloning kit for both beginners and experienced growers alike. It contains the items necessary to take cuttings and root them successfully. Use the included Clonex clone solution, mist and gel to help your cuttings get the necessary nutrients they need for explosive root growth. In addition there is an instruction card to help you with any questions, a clone tray and a shot glass for dipping. This kit ensures that you will have a successful cloning experience each and every time. Success will be fast and easy with this all-inclusive kit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LbMahZZ6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clonex","source_asin":"B00CJIYCZ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CJIYCZ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CJIYCZ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
