window.products.push({"id":1147233,"name":"TRIXES Inflatable Pillow for Travel or Camping - Blow up Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ttgsa0+BL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Inflatable comfort pillows for avid travellers Travelling has its share of hardships and sleeping can also prove something of a challenge however those with a love of the outdoors need look no further than these soft inflatable pillows. They are the perfect size for individual use and ideal to take away camping or backpacking, so you have somewhere comfortable to rest your head. Incredibly compact, they can be neatly packed up in a travel bag or suitcase when not in use and have a lovely soft flocked design to contour to the shape of your head. Now you are laying comfortably, all you need worry about is deciding whether or not to share them! Information SINGLE SIZE; The pillows are just the right size for individual use. The pillows are rectangular shaped, with concave edges. Corner to corner, the pillows are 35 cm x 22 cm. The size measuring from the minimum point of the curved edges is 33 cm x 20 cm. The pillows are curved to provide optimum cushioning to your head. When fully inflated the maximum depth is 10cm and the depth at the bottom of the indentation is 8cm NOT ONLY FOR CAMPING; These pillows can be taken on long haul fights as a seat cushion and make a great blow up pillow for the beach. What’s more, they can be positioned on sun loungers to support your head and neck. Lay on the grass to gaze up above at the stars or take with you on a relaxing picnic so you can lounge around in the parkDON’T DELAY; The 30-day money back guarantee gives you complete peace of mind so don’t miss out!Contains2 x Inflatable blue travel pillows","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ttgsa0+BL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRIXES","source_asin":"B005FVZUHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005FVZUHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005FVZUHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
