window.products.push({"id":1147320,"name":"HOME & LOUNGE Bath Towel Sheets - Extra Large 100% Turkish Cotton Spa and Hotel Towel - 35 Inch by 60 Inch - Luxury Soft and Comfortable Sheet - Machi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mztcdJU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you ever went to the bath towel sheet with a bad towel and were unsatisfied? Well now you won’t be with our Turkish Bath Towel you can dry up in a matter of minutes with the extremely fast and absorbing fine fibers. Cotton and high quality has always been embedded in the Turkish culture since the Ottoman Empire in the 17th Century spread across the world. Used in baths,spas and anywhere the sultan wanted now it’s your chance to feel the premium quality used in these towels and fabrics. Odorless- This towels stays odorless and fresh after use. Beneficial to stay comfy while using our towel at the beach or to dry off after a long day at the beach. Absorbs away moisture - Our extremely absorbent towels wick away the moisture on your body and quickly dry you off for a fast exit from the beach. Hypoallergenic - Extremely unlikely to cause any type of allergic reaction or health hazard which is overall beneficial to your health and well being. Eco-Friendly- All of our Bath Towels are Eco-Friendly and does not contain chemicals. Made from strong durable fibers and safe for you and the family at home and at the beach. Remarkably Versatile- Extremely absorbent and soft cotton Turkish Cabana Beach Towel is great for lakes, beaches, rivers, and anywhere with sand and water. RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We are committed to our 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION so if you find that you are not 5-STAR HAPPY with us or our products, please contact us and we will do whatever it takes quickly to make sure you are 100% satisfied. Order One Right Now and Feel like a Sultan today! Machine washable cold.Tumble dry low, Do not bleach. Size: 35” X 60” Weight: 1.35 lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mztcdJU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME & LOUNGE","source_asin":"B076MCT8BL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MCT8BL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MCT8BL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
