window.products.push({"id":1147350,"name":"LivePure Ultrasonic Humidifier, White, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5124KHNE99L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description The LivePure Ultrasonic Humidifier is a modern, compact humidifier that uses vibration to safely and effectively create water vapor, rather than dangerous heat or expensive filters that need frequent replacing. It's great for healthy skin, healthy sinuses, better sleep, even a healthy environment to support your immune system. From the Manufacturer Safe, Clean Operation The LivePure Ultrasonic Humidifier features the groundbreaking Ultrasonic Operation, which eliminates the safety issue associated with hot water humidifiers. The clean operation also eliminates the need for filters, which can breed mold and mildew. There is no need to clean with harsh chemicals - simply rinse with natural vinegar and water. Embrace health When air is dry, our sinuses don't drain properly, and the resulting congestion can lead to sinus pain and infection. Viruses and bacteria don't travel easily through moist air - humidified air reduces your susceptibility to airborne illnesses. When sinuses and throats are dried out, we snore more. More moisture in the air will improve quality of sleep. Convenient The LivePure Ultrasonic Humidifier has a modern and compact design. Its clean lines fit any décor and it is perfect on a nightstand, table, dresser, or counter. The unique oval shape fits narrow spaces for better air anywhere. High Performance Perfect for an 86 to 108 square foot space, this produces 4.8 liters of vapor on a single fill, which lasts 6-7 hours (depending on the speed setting). It beeps when it is time to refill and automatically powers off when the water is gone. Quiet and Versatile The LivePure Ultrasonic Humidifier is super quiet and the ultra-fine mist output is optimized for the best, most effective humidifier benefits. Use it in the bedroom, kitchen, den, even in a kid’s room. Breathe A Better Life LivePure is proud to bring you home-environment products inspired by nature and active lifestyles, free of gimmicks, additives, and pollutants, helping you ensure your air is the purest it can be – so you feel and look your best!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5124KHNE99L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LivePure","source_asin":"B075B6MYHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075B6MYHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075B6MYHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
