window.products.push({"id":1147718,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner,Personal Air Cooler, 3-in-1 Evaporative with 3 Speeds,Ice Packs,2500 mAh Battery (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HTJwZCUmS._AC_SL1478_.jpg","description":"【Fan & Humidifier & Cooling 3-IN-1】 If you live in a dry climate and want an cost-effective cooling solution, our small portable air conditioner must be worth considering. There are 3 modes for you: wind / humidification by adding water / cooling quicker with ice. It combines classic evaporative cooler technology and innovative ice packs design for rapid cooling. Fit to anywhere: bedroom,room,car,tent,camper,desk,desktop. 【2021 Upgrade Innovative Cooling Technology】【Ice Packs Design Rapid Cooling】Fill the ice packs with water and freeze for a few hours. and Place in mini air conditioner portable to Achieve rapid cooling. 【Ours Personal Air Cooler NO Filter Means Not Moldy and Need't Replaced】Because we use ice packs instead of filters.Traditional air coolers claim that filters purify the air. In fact After a few months, the filter gets black and slimy ,although you use distilled water. you have spent more in replaced on filters than spent on the air conditioner portable. 【The Water Tank is Fully Enclosed, Don't Worry About Overturning! 】So Even if your child or cat touches it, it can be used with confidence. Most portable air conditioners are designed to operate only on a stable flat surface. Can not tilt, must be used with care. Imagine it accidentally get tipped over 【300ML large capacity】you can keep yourself away from dry air and enjoy the mist for 3-5 hours. The portable ac air conditioner performs the best during hot, dry climates or to combat dryness brought by A/Cs（ac）. 【Built-in 2500 mAh Battery & Type-C Input 】This mini room air cooler is equipped with Type C power(usb) supply system to provide a safer power input. You can use the Type c power cable included in the package to connect adapter, power bank, computer or car charger. and the built-in battery can also allow the product to work without an external power supply. Built-in 2500 mAh battery can working continuously for 2-5 hours when fully charged. 【7 Color-Cycle Lights Option】- 7 Different Colors with Color-Cycle Option! You can set the setting to automatic Color Cycling, or you can fix the color you like. lights can be turn off solely, when you don’t need it, you can just turn the light off but still enjoy the cool wind. 【Quiet】: Quiet, really quiet, not completely no noise, but the sound of the Portable Air Conditioner will make you feel comfortable. ★This Fan is for Personal Use, no coolant, cannot cool down a small room, please don’t put it too far away from you.★","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HTJwZCUmS._AC_SL1478_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PBOX","source_asin":"B091CVYQHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091CVYQHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091CVYQHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
