window.products.push({"id":1147743,"name":"SO CAL PRO Dream Catcher Feather Pendant Wall Hanging for Car Home Girls Kids Nursery Mobile Bedroom Decoration Decor Many Styles and Colors to Choose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmZP8P8cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our dream catcher is lightweight and versatile for easy hanging from a wall or window frame. This is a perfect decoration for your home, nursery, party or as a wonderful gift. Please see the dimensions below… ✅Pink and Purple Unicorn Size: Diameter of ring is approximately 7.9\", and the length is approximately 28\" The purple and pink do not light up. ✅LED Dream catcher approximate Size: Unicorn head height: 7 inch/18 cm; Total length: 19.7 inch/50 cm. LED Material: Made of unicorn shape metal circle, colorful feathers, cotton ribbons, beads, LED string light. (Warm white, Battery powered) ✅Boho Gold Approximate Measurements: 8 Inches in diameter, 19 inches in length (with an additional 4 inches in string to hang so 23 inches total) ✅ Moon Approximate measurements: Diameter--7.8 Inches, Length--26 inches (plus an additional 3 inches of string to hang so 29 inches all together) ✅ Rainbow Approximate measurements: Diameter of ring is approximately 8\", and with the feathers extended, it is approximately 31\" long. ✅ White Approximate measurements are: 4 1/2 inches in diameter, 17 inches long (plus an additional 4 inches in string so (21 inches total) ✅Approximate dreamcatcher measurements: 8 inches in diameter, 26 inches in length The LED is Warm white, Battery powered. You simply turn it on and off as needed. ✅ Due to the different monitors and lighting the color may appear different in person than on the screen. ✅ For packing purposes this item is made and then gently folded and placed into a plastic wrapping for protection. Once you receive it you will want to adjust some of the ribbons and flowers to make sure everything is facing forward upon hanging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JmZP8P8cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SO CAL PRO","source_asin":"B08HJQ8GB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HJQ8GB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HJQ8GB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
