window.products.push({"id":1147774,"name":"MASGEMES Handmade Healing Chakra Crystal Tree,Natural Amethyst Tree Copper Wrapped with Row Clear Quartz Cluster Base,Gemstone Tree Bonsai Feng Shui M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cKxLGWwyL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"GEMSTONE BONSAI TREE: Our Crystal bonsai money tree is handmade of natural Gemstone and hand selected with high energy gem-grade Crystals which hand -twisted with copper wire. It’s also called \"Wishing Tree\", This Gemstone Tree is Good for Home Decor with chakra Crystal Healing,Improve career luck as well as an excellent Feng Shui for those who are in managerial positions . Put it in your living room or office. It will help you attract wealth and prosperity, success, and all good things. PRODUCT SIZE&COLOR: This tree stands about 5.6-6.4 inches tall. These Crystal Trees are furnished on a Amethys Cluster Base. Since it is all about natural material when it comes to the tree base, each and every one is unique in terms of shape, color and size. HEALING PROPERTIES:The meaning of Amethyst is spiritual healing, calmness, and wisdom.Amethyst also associated with healthy cell regeneration, encouraging soothing sleep and rest, and promoting hormonal balance.At a base level, Amethyst is renowned for bringing a sense of calm and clarity to our chaotic world. Those who keep Amethyst close will find that they feel comforted, grounded and soothed in a truly uplifting way. CLEAR QUARTZ CLUSTER:Clear Quartz Crystals emit calming energy and promote clarity of thought, helping you to focus on your dreams and desires. A cluster crystal forms when many crystal points grow together and become one. Cluster crystals radiate high energy due to the united power of each crystal and direct it out through the crystals many points. GIFT BOX:Our Gemstone Crystal Tree comes with a Gift Box, it's a perfect gift for every occasion. It’s A good gifts for you, your families and your friends or someone important in you life. If you have any question, please contact us freely. We will do our best to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cKxLGWwyL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASGEMES","source_asin":"B09MPCNNLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MPCNNLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MPCNNLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147775,"name":"Samawi 12\" Blue and White Ceramic Vase Modern Vase Floor vase for Décor Tall Vase Ceramic Vase Large Vase for Flowers Home Dining Kitchen Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rfEQ2bLRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Decorating your home need not be expensive! Our affordable range of flower vases and accent pieces in white ceramic will add a wow factor to your home without being heavy on your pocket. The vases have a unique and eye catching designs that will add a contemporary touch to your home decor. They are crafted with high grade ceramic in pristine white and have a smooth glossy finish. This piece has a traditional shape of a vase but has a hollowed middle and bottom design with a bottle neck that provides a modern look. White colour ensures that it can go with all kinds of home decor. It will blend in or stand out according to the place setting you do. DECORE IDEAS It can be used on any kind of shelvings such as book shelves or wall shelves and can be mixed and matched with other items. It can be used as vase with long stem flowers as centrepieces for dining room and living room table. Couple it with small knickknacks or photos to provide height. Place it on deep window sill or coffee table near window where it can catch light. It can also be used as decorative piece for fireplace mantle, coffee table and side table. It will go beautifully with wooden furnishings and outdoor settings and therefore is an ideal choice for farmhouse decor. Its white colour provides a cooling and soothing effect and thus it is an ideal choice for summer party decor. It can be paired with fresh flowers and can be used as centrepieces for wedding parties table decoration. It is a versatile piece and you can use it as a standalone accessory or combine it with other decor accessories to create new and exciting combinations that will provide a chic and urbane look to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rfEQ2bLRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samawi HOME DECORS","source_asin":"B08MJJFPZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MJJFPZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MJJFPZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147776,"name":"Luxury Chenille Bathroom Rugs with Non Slip Bath Mat for Tub Bottom, Kids Bath Rugs for Bathroom with Water Absorbent Mat Piles, Machine Washable Rug ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZK4bX4+wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ SERENE COMFORT FOR A BLISSFUL EXPERIENCE: July Home’s bathroom rug provides you with exceptional comfort every time you or your kids step out of the shower and protects your feet from the cold floor. In comparison to other bathroom mats, our newest shower mat is more fluffy and cushioned, reaching 1.8 inches in height. Experience pure bliss as you step on fluffy rug 💦 ABSORBENT PILE DESIGN FOR INSTANT DRYNESS: Thanks to the thousands of individual microfiber rods, this high-pile shaggy rug traps moisture in its deep water absorbent piles, allowing the bath tub mat to dry quickly and prevent water buildup underneath. Worry no more about soaking your floor or accidentally slipping each time you get out of the shower thanks to our quick absorbent water mat 💯 ENSURE YOUR FEET STAY FIRMLY IN PLACE WITH CONFIDENCE: The use of the new innovative technology of the hot melt adhesive backing keeps our bath mats for bathroom non-slip, ensuring they stay in place and prevent you from accidentally slipping or skidding on your way out. It’s best to keep your floors clean and clear of any dust or water when using our shower mats to ensure the correct use 🧼 LAUNDERABLE FABRIC FOR CONSTANT FRESHNESS: We take pride in our work and stand behind each of our bath rugs to ensure they are machine washable. Rest assured of its anti-fading fabric and enjoy its vibrant colors after each clean thanks to its long lasting & durable material that allows our machine washable rugs to hold up over time. Simply, wash it with cold water and mild detergent, tumble dry on low-speed, and then shake to revive cushioned fluff material within 💕 A POSH COMPLEMENT TO YOUR BATHROOM DESIGN: Our plush rug serves as a beautiful and functional enhancement to any home. Experience its versatile uses around the house as a kitchen mat, bedroom rug, entryway rug, and even an outdoor rug. What better way to spruce up your bathroom decor than with our superb bath rugs as one of your bathroom accessories","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZK4bX4+wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JULY HOME","source_asin":"B099FBPK26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099FBPK26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099FBPK26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
