window.products.push({"id":1147779,"name":"Welhome 100% Organic Cotton Solid Pre-Washed Bedding Sheet Sets with Pillowcases | 4 Piece | Queen | Ochre Yellow | Deep Pockets Fits Mattress Upto 16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V+PxRks0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Organic Cotton Imported EASY STYLISH DESIGN as you can choose from a range of neutral colors for easy coordination no matter the season or pops of fun trendy colors. Classics colorways for easy mixing and matching with any existing bedding and home décor. Or add a delightful mix of color for a refresh. Pair or gift with the Welhome Relax Duvet Cover Set to complete the look. Each sold separately. Queen Set Includes: 1 flat sheet (90in x 102in) 1 fitted sheet (60in x 80in + 16in) 2 standard pillowcases (20in x 30in). SLEEP WELL with a comfortable 100% organic cotton sheet. Search no further for a natural feel and look that includes a mood boosting pre-washed hand feel for everyday softness. This breathable 230 thread-count allows comfort to come naturally. Perfect for yourself or as a gift ideal choice for a first-class sleep experience. Easy to pair back with duvet covers, blankets, throws, decorative pillows and great for the environment, while stylish for your bedroom. MUST HAVE FEATURES so you can relax and unwind. The Solid Washed Organic Cotton Sheet Set by Welhome are healthy for you and healthy for the planet. These sheets have been thoughtfully produced from 100% organic cotton and have been pre-washed for everyday softness. A 4-inch hem creates a clean tailored look. The fit was made to boost your beauty sleep with an all-around elastic band for a snug fit. Fitting a mattress up to 16” deep, the deep pockets will keep sheets snug in place all night. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, standard machine washable, soft, and breathable, lightweight cotton. Machine wash warm, normal cycle. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Warm iron if needed. Our sustainable cotton sheet set is environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable unlike microfiber that is difficult to break down. Be sure to buy 2 sets for each bed to save time & money. DESIGNED WITH CARE, our packaging is made using sustainable PEVA, a less toxic alternative to vinyl that can cause a cloudiness in its overall color structure and is chlorine and phthalate-free. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V+PxRks0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B09ZVPMDF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZVPMDF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZVPMDF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
