window.products.push({"id":1147786,"name":"Nostalgia New and Improved Wide 2-Slice Toaster Perfect For Bread, English Muffins, Bagels, 5 Browning Levels, With Crumb Tray & Cord Storage, Retro R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c7eHl6aoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooking a bagel has never been easier with a powerful 900-watt toaster that's equipped to handle all of your toasting needs. Designed to accommodate a variety of breads, two large toasting slots provide ample room for toasting everything from thick slices of bread to bagel halves. Adjust the doneness by choosing from five browning levels for lightly or darkly toasted bread. Also featured are defrost and cancel options, along with a bagel button that automatically adjusts the toasting time for thicker breads like bagels and English muffins. Each control button illuminates when pressed for easy recognition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c7eHl6aoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nostalgia","source_asin":"B00ZTSHE6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZTSHE6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZTSHE6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147787,"name":"DYNH Sea Turtle Shower Curtain, Under The Sea Ocean Animals Shower Curtain Underwater Tortoise Seaweed Fish Shower Curtain, Sea Creatures Turquoise Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719t1uN9oMS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SIZE--69WX70H (inch) Vintage Sea Turtle Shower Curtain, suitable for most bathtubs, No liner needed, included 12 plastic hooks. MATERIAL--Soft Elegant Polyester Fabric Underwater Ocean World Bathroom Curtain Sea Turtle Curtain PATTERN--3D digital printing, brighten your bathroom, color is gorgeous and not faded. CARE--machine washable,Easy to clean, hang dry. USES--bath curtains can also be used as wallpapers, backdrop cloth, Window curtains, tablecloths, canvas, closets dust cover, Wall tapestry, Kitchen or bedroom curtain, Beach Blanket ,dressing room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719t1uN9oMS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DYNH","source_asin":"B094D9D6W9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094D9D6W9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094D9D6W9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147788,"name":"neatcleats Wall Mounted Shoe Storage - Precision Built Cycle Shoe Hangers Come in Pairs So Each Cleat Hooks Safely Against Any Wall Or Flat Surface (S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZXPi9SXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️ WHO WE ARE: We are a dynamic trio of cycling professionals and enthusiasts.  We enjoy taking our bikes down a winding backcountry forest dirt trail or taking command along the road miles upon miles in search of adventure. Our background in metalwork and design coupled with a passion for cycling made us decide to put our skills to use by creating NeatCleats. We know you will enjoy our hard work. ☑️ MEET THE TEAM: We would love for you to meet our Team! ALISTAIR: He has a career background in product and industrial design with a top interest in cycling. After commuting to work every day via bike, Alistair developed a bracket to hang his cleats on the wall. His breakthrough design led to another using a carabiner tool and behold Zpurs and NeatCleats were born.  Today he works with pro teams while still working and enjoying cycling to the fullest. SOPHIE: She began cycling in 2016 during the Zwift generation and has earned her Tron bike through a series of hard-fought races.  Her biggest accomplishment was completing the 100 mile Rapha Challenge in September 2019.  Today she still pushes the limits and boundaries of her own performance while caring for two darling kids and running accounts for us. JESSICA: She is a passionate mountain bike guide in the extra beautiful Afan Valley.  She is also the founder of Velo Me.  She creates and manages our social media and website content.  But in her off time, she enjoys riding through the slim mountain trails. ☑️ SHARE: We would love to have you follow us on Instagram and share your cycling pictures from sea to summit.  And please send us a photo of how our NeatCleats units are helping you stay tidy organizers.  In the meantime, thanks for your purchase and keep on cycling!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZXPi9SXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"neatcleats","source_asin":"B08DS1Y1HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DS1Y1HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DS1Y1HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147789,"name":"eLuxurySupply 400 Thread Count - Long Staple Cotton Striped Sheet Set, Twin, Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51huWQkBR7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our 100% Long Staple Cotton 400 Thread Count Striped Sheet Sets are the perfect product for anyone looking for ultra soft sheets that still maintain the durability and quality of high thread count luxury linens. These sheets will literally become softer and softer with every wash, so there is no limit to the amount of comfort that they will provide. They're available in multiple size ranges and colors making up almost 200 options! Whether the sheets are a gift for a friend or you are buying for yourself, you know you are getting top-quality luxury with eLuxurySupply. Why is Long Staple Cotton so much better for your sheets? Quite simply, Long Staple Cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns, and turned into the softest sheets you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply sheets use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lighter-weight fabric with exceptional drape and softness. You have our word that we will do everything that we can to make sure returning your product is not necessary. However, should the need arise for any reason, please contact us to obtain authorization for a full refund or exchange if you have any issues with your product. Please request this refund or exchange within 30 days of receiving your order. For all returns within the 30 day return period, eLuxurySupply will provide a prepaid return label for a completely free return.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51huWQkBR7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eLuxurySupply","source_asin":"B00K8CSH1O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K8CSH1O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K8CSH1O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
