window.products.push({"id":1147798,"name":"Digital Kitchen Scale, 200g 0.01 Gram Accuracy, Pocket Scale Gram Scale for Food Ounces and Grams, Jewelry Scale, Coffee Scale, Battery Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZCgbDSAHS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"1、Units Conversion: g/oz/ct/ozt. 2、Weighing rage: 0-200g. 3、Weighing Sensitivity: 0.01g + 50g Calibration Weight. 4、Error Range: ±0.03g. 5、Product size: 5.04*3.0*0.75inch. 6、Product Net Weight: 248g. 7、Power supply style: 2*1.5V AAA battery (included). How to Use this: 1、Place the scale on a horizontal flat surface, press ON/OFF button to turn it on. 2、Wait for a few seconds until \"0.00\" is displayed on the screen. 3、Put the items on the weighing platform. Tare Weighing: 1、Turn on the scale as described above. 2、Place the \"container\" on the platform. 3、Press TARE and wait for seconds until \"0.00\" is displayed. 4、Place the \"net-weight-item\" on the scale to read the weight. Regarding precise measurement, here are some usage methods as below: 1. The scale must be placed on a very stable horizontal flat surface, even small vibrations will affect the accuracy, sometimes significantly affecting the readings. 2. No vibration and wind environment is required. 3. When using the digital scale for the first time, please use the weight to calibrate the weighing. Changes in latitude and longitude will affect its accuracy. Please note:there is no calibration weight on the scale set.  4. When you press the \"TARE\" Button, your \"container\"+“your item”≤200g.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZCgbDSAHS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tobole","source_asin":"B0943PY7BQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0943PY7BQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0943PY7BQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
