window.products.push({"id":1147875,"name":"WANTONG Christmas Curtain Lights, 138 LED Window String Lights Including Bell, Deer, Star, Christmas Tree with 8 Flashing Modes for Christmas, Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kso+t3k8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Dimension: With whole length of lights is 3M, there’s an extra 1.5M for plugs. This Christamas LED curtain lights has 12 strands of Christmas ornaments lights, including 6 stars, 2 Christmas trees, 2 elks and 2 bells, of which the sagging length is from 20“ to 26”. Modes: Each Christamas Curtain Lights are equipped an lights controller, features 8 dynamic modes: Combination, In waves, Sequential, Slo-Glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow fade, Twinkle/flash and Steady on. Also, you can Increase and decrease the brightness or set timer for 6 hours. Switch with one button and feel different effects. Application: Where there is this Christamas Curtain lights, there is an amazing warm world to you, its wonderful decorative for festival, New Year, theme party, birthday etc. It is full of Christmas flavor. Elegant and simple are the key points of the design. Design: This stylish Christmas decoration is made of waterproof, corrosion resistant PVC ring shell, it is battery-powered to avoid dangers caused by excessive voltage. Low-voltage ensures great safety, which will not be harmed by contact with the copper wire. After-Sales Service: If there’s any questions about lights, please feel free to contact us. We want to ensure every customer 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kso+t3k8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANTONG","source_asin":"B0BQCLPS5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQCLPS5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQCLPS5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1147876,"name":"Portable Soda Maker Kit, Homemade Sparkling Water Maker Beverages Machine with 10 Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OZYHtRXTL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"Designed for sparkling beverage fans, EEX SODA MAKER is The most convenient way to make your drink with real flavors and the bubbles you crave Not only does CO2 give a nice mouth-feel, but it also lifts aromatic molecules up toward the nose, which is where most of our fine tasting occurs! It also forms carbonic acid when mixed with water, which gives your drink that slight acidic bite that hurts so good! This isn't just a soda machine No syrups required. Easily sparkle your favorite drink and infuse the delicious tastes of real ingredients - into any drink！ The recipe is up to you! Bubbly the way you want it, with the perfect amount of bubbles! You also get to decide how many bubbles to infuse your drinks with. Sometimes you’ll want a little - and sometimes you’ll want a lot! Say goodbye to returning empty CO2 tanks. EEX C02 bottle are delivered to you.Your days of returning CO2 tanks to the store are over. We send C02 directly to you! How EEX SODA MAKER Works In a sealed chamber, water mixes with the EEX Carbonator, producing CO2.EEX pressurizes the bottle.Pressure squeezes the ingredients' flavor into the drink. Step 1: Putting C02 into the main unit Step 2: Cap the cap and rotate it Step 3: Wait 20 seconds, shake for 5 seconds Step 4: Enjoy your CO2 enhanced beverage! Tips : Cold liquids will hold carbonation better than warm water. Use filtered water when possible. For the reasons mentioned above, carbonation can sometimes bring out the taste of minerals or chemicals in water. To ensure proper functionality, please ensure bubbles going into the bottle after pressing start. If no (or very few) bubbles go in the bottle, firmly push the bottle down at the beginning of the cycle. You may be experiencing an early use issue that can be permanently corrected by doing so.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OZYHtRXTL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EEX","source_asin":"B086QMSCWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086QMSCWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086QMSCWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
