window.products.push({"id":1147891,"name":"Yustuf 10-pack Clear Stackable Refrigerator Organizer Bins with 4 liners, Plastic Pantry Organization and Storage Bins with lids Vegetable Fruit Stora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-CLp-ldWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food grade safe material: Made of clear durable PET plastic, BPA free, with good hardness and high transparency, can be used for a long time. The transparent design gives you a clear view and you can easily see what is stored and quickly find the items you need. One set of 10 fridge organizers: One set includes 3 different sizes, 1 large size 11.8 x 11.8 x 3.9 inches, 3 medium sizes 10.5 x 3.6 x 3.4 inches, and 6 small sizes 4.9 x 3.0 x 2.8 inches. There are also four white drain trays. These refrigerator organizer bins are stackable to meet your daily needs. Multifunctional design: Stacked design to help maximize the use of your refrigerator storage space. The lid of the fruit containers for fridge is not airtight, which can effectively prevent dust and odor. The largest containers have a drain hole at the bottom that can be easily opened after washing vegetables and fruits to drain excess water and keep them fresh. Ideal storage option: Easily organize space to store fruits, vegetables, food, drinks, cans, condiments, produce, dry food, pre-cut foods, meatsand other items. These produce saver containers for refrigerator can also be placed in cabinets, freezers, pantries and countertops as storage. Note: Do not wash in the dishwasher, microwave or oven. Wash with soap in warm water (temperature range: -20°C to 65°C).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-CLp-ldWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yustuf","source_asin":"B0B94FNB53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B94FNB53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B94FNB53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
