window.products.push({"id":1147967,"name":"Seven-first Space Heater, Portable Oscillating Electric Heater, Tip-Over and Overheat Protection, Small Heater with Fast Heating and Natural Fan Modes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712cFEJLmEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Our Portable Electric Space Heater? ♨Keep quiet and warm with our 1200W/600W Powerful Ceramic Space Heater. 3 heating-settings and safe ceramic element solution provides convenient and comfortable warming. Special designed for dorm, bedroom, office and many other medium size living spaces. Energy Efficient Heater ♨ The advanced PTC ceraming heating technology combined with the ultra-efficient fan, this heater can save electric bills by quickly heating up needed small spaces instead of heating the whole house with other centralized heaters. It's quiet enough to use in a bedroom while sleeping. Auto Shut-Off if Tipped Over ♨ The portable electric space heater for office is equipped with a safety tip-over switch,When accidentally tilted or hit, the heater will turn off automatically to avoid accidents. 1200W Heating & 6 Modes ♨ Our electric heaters for home is suitable for you. There are 6 modes of our heated fan, including low, high heating settings and fan only. With 1200W and 600W heat settings, this heated fan can eliminate cold spots quickly in winter. Besides, by rotating the power switch to different positions, this electric space heater can be used as a normal fan which can promote air circulation. Specification * Net Weight :2.6lbs * Gross Weight:3 lbs * Frequency:50Hz * Product Dimensions：6.5X6.5X11.4in * Output Power(W):1500W * Voltage:120v Note · When the product is used for the first time, the protective oil on the surface of the product will have an odor after being heated, which is a normal phenomenon. Leave it in a ventilated place for a while. · Before cleaning or trying to store items, make sure that the device is turned off. Do not immerse the heater in water, as this may cause the risk of electric shock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712cFEJLmEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seven-first","source_asin":"B09JNRW6CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1147967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JNRW6CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JNRW6CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
